<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    h1 { color: #38a169; }
    .footer { font-size: 0.9em; color: #718096; margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 15px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Your Course is Approved!</h1>
    <p>Hello <strong><%= teacherName %></strong>,</p>
    <p>Congratulations! Your course <strong>"<%= courseName %>"</strong> has been approved by the administration and is now published and live.</p>
    <p>Students can now discover and enroll in your course.</p>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Thank you for contributing to our platform!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
